sequenceDiagram
 box rgb(235,244,255) MindSpeed-LLM
  participant T as trainer.py
  participant O as optimizer.py
  participant P as profiler.py
 end
 box rgb(234,247,240) FSDPTurbo / FSDP
  participant E as state.py
  participant G as param_group.py
 end
 box rgb(255,246,236) MegaMoE Native / Kernel
  participant B as fsdp2_bridge.py
 end
 Note over T,B: 接反向 kernel。各副本梯度已在 EP 组内归到专家 owner
 B-->>G: B17 autograd 将 owner dW 交回 Parameter
 G->>G: U04 post_backward：收集梯度，reshard，foreach_reduce
 G-->>E: Expert-FSDP 组内 reduce-scatter / scaling
 E-->>T: 反向完成，分片梯度可供 optimizer 使用
 T->>T: U06 累积结束 → clip_grad_norm → 检查 finite
 T->>O: U07 optimizer.step 更新框架参数分片
 T->>T: U08 scheduler.step、zero_grad，下一步重新 publish
 T->>P: U09 profiler.step；训练循环结束后 profiler.stop
 Note over T: 本次训练 save_steps/save_epochs 为0，HF权重导出关闭
